  "goodToKnow": "Der Seelsorger (die Seelsorgerin) is a pastor or chaplain giving pastoral care, in parishes, hospitals, prisons, the army or after disasters (Notfallseelsorge). Die Seelsorge is pastoral care. Germany's Telefonseelsorge, run by the Protestant and Catholic churches, offers free, anonymous support day and night at 0800 111 0 111 and 0800 111 0 222. The plural is the same: die Seelsorger."
